@startuml
title Deployment Diagram
left to right direction
skinparam rectangleBackgroundColor #E8F0FE
skinparam rectangleBorderColor #2563EB
rectangle "Browser\nReact SPA\nDjango admin" as browser
rectangle "Vite dev server\ndev/build/preview" as vite
rectangle "Django ASGI\nconfig.asgi:application\nDaphne for WS" as django
rectangle "DRF / Channels\n5 prefixes\n2 consumers" as drf
rectangle "PostgreSQL\nmandatory\nblacklist tables" as pg
rectangle "Redis channel layer\nif REDIS_URL set\nmulti-process fan-out" as redis
rectangle "In-memory layer\ndefault fallback\nsingle-process" as memory
rectangle "Media storage\nMEDIA_ROOT\ndev served if DEBUG" as media
rectangle "Email provider\nreset links" as email
rectangle "Reverse proxy / TLS\nnot found in source" as proxy
browser --> vite : dev SPA
browser --> django : API/WS
vite --> django : proxy in dev
django --> drf
drf --> pg
drf --> redis : if configured
drf --> memory : otherwise
drf --> media
drf --> email : password reset
proxy ..> django : [NOT VERIFIED - USER CONFIRMATION REQUIRED]
@enduml
